y re-render what changed: on each poll, compare the new snapshot with the previous one and update only changed text/width/class values; do not rebuild the DOM. Keep all data bindings.\n4) Update tests/command-center-perf-budget.test.mjs (and/or add a browser perf test) to lock in: animation frame budget/pause-on-hidden/reduced-motion, no Hive robot load, lazy Cockpit decoration, poll interval, and asset gzip budgets. Keep every existing command-center/cc/watch-assets test green. Verify: node --import ./tests/_isolate-config.mjs --test tests/command-center-perf-budget.test.mjs tests/cc-hive-mount.test.mjs tests/cc-cockpit-mount.test.mjs tests/command-center-boot.test.mjs tests/command-center-hive.test.mjs tests/command-center-cockpit.test.mjs tests/command-center-routes-flag.test.mjs -> all pass. Report before/after idle CPU and switch time from your own fixture run. You have read/write access to cc-router.js and the robot modules; the Hive initial static import graph must not pull the robot modules.",
